    "defaultMode": "Doubt turned inward builds a reputation you cannot see: hesitant, hard to commit, always one more check away from a decision. Aimed outward without warmth it becomes a habit of puncturing, and people stop showing you early ideas because they arrive back damaged, while roles go to people who spoke with conviction while you were still qualifying.",
